        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Adjusting the fix here solves it, although it's too broad a fix: https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/38684#issuecomment-4189475907\n\n```diff\n       // Decide which of the highlight attributes to use.\n-      if (area_attr != 0) {\n+      if (extmark_attr != 0 /*&& something about mcursor*/) {\n+        char_attr_pri = hl_combine_attr(wlv.line_attr, extmark_attr);\n+      } else if (area_attr != 0) {\n         char_attr_pri = hl_combine_attr(wlv.line_attr, area_attr);\n```\n\n~~Also related is #18756, which is about search highlighting having a high priority~~ (duplicate mention, I can't read)",
